<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RMP says Randgold buy progressing.</title>
<headline>RMP says Randgold buy progressing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Considerable progress had been made in talks concerning the purchase by Randgold &amp; Exploration Co Ltd of RMP Properties Ltd's land clearing and gold recovery operations, RMP and Barprop Ltd said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shareholders in RMP and Barprop were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings. A further announcement would be published by the end of April.</p>
<p>This cautionary follows an earlier one on February 5 which informed shareholders of the proposed rationalistion of the firms' listings, a capital restructure and the potential Randgold purchase.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
